# MANIFEST.in — production-build exclusions for the source distribution.
#
# This file mirrors `[tool.muse.production-build]` in pyproject.toml, which
# carries the full rationale. The short version:
#
#   recovered-agent-sources/ is the byte-preserved archival snapshot of the
#   2026-07-12 device-consolidation recovery. It is historical evidence, not
#   live code, and it deliberately contains a broken prototype whose
#   tools/delegate_tool.py raises IndentationError at line 970.
#
#   It must be EXCLUDED from build artifacts and RETAINED ON DISK. Do not
#   delete the tree to make a build or a lint run pass — the exclusion below
#   is the supported fix, and deleting the evidence is not.
#
# `tests/characterization/test_build_exclusions.py` asserts that this file,
# pyproject.toml and the on-disk tree stay in agreement.
prune recovered-agent-sources
